Subject: [PATCH 4/4] docs: fix PowerShell patch apply command

---
 CARA_INSTALL.md | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/CARA_INSTALL.md b/CARA_INSTALL.md
index 6c11dd4..78eeafb 100644
--- a/CARA_INSTALL.md
+++ b/CARA_INSTALL.md
@@ -65,9 +65,12 @@ Lalu di laptop baru, terapkan patch setelah clone:
 
 ```powershell
 cd "$HOME\.config\opencode\skills\qa-e2e-tester"
-git am patches/*.patch
+$patches = Get-ChildItem .\patches -Filter *.patch | Sort-Object Name | ForEach-Object { $_.FullName }
+git am $patches
 ```
 
+Catatan: di PowerShell, `git am patches/*.patch` tidak selalu ke-expand, jadi pakai `Get-ChildItem` seperti di atas.
